{"parse": {"title": "雨前漫游指南3.1/剧情", "pageid": 119501, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">剧情</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9B.A8.E5.89.8D.E6.BC.AB.E6.B8.B8.E6.8C.87.E5.8D.973.1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"雨前漫游指南3.1\">雨前漫游指南3.1</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 雨前漫游指南3.1</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>初次探索</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>再次探索</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>第三结局</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-633010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-633010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-633010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯研究员：</div><div>77 114 46 32 85 108 114 105 99 104?</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯研究员：</div><div>84 104 101 114 101 39 115 32 97 32 102 111 120 32 104 101 114 101 32 116 111 32 115 101 101 32 121 111 117。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间里的人比研究员以为的要多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他礼貌地向哑谜、冷周六、兔毛手袋三位同僚，总跟在星锑研究员后头的APPLe先生，以及一位佩戴基金会徽章的小姐点头致意，然后等待乌尔里希组长的回复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正埋头于一叠报告的磁流体抬起头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯研究员：</div><div>79104！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员仿佛才想起来什么一般，从口袋里掏出一个机器，对着它将那几串冗长的数字又重复了一遍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人等待着。几秒后，那个小小的金属盒子里响起了合成人声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">转译器：</div><div>抱歉，乌尔里希组长，我忘了开转译器——有个奇怪的狐狸头想要找你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>噢，没事，我本来该反应过来你说的是十进制，但我正在看一篇八进制的报告……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乌尔里希摆了摆手，像是要把数字们从眼前挥开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>是缪斯三世来了，我们马上过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>讲着奇怪编码的研究员离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间里的黑发男人在这场对话刚开始时就面露讥讽，而现在显然是一个不必再克制的好时机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>三分钟，真惊人。多亏了你在玩具箱里的人文关怀，现在我们的交流效率堪比猿猴。也许再过一星期我们就能抛弃无意义的喊叫，进化到用壁画记事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这和我的人文关怀没有一点关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体恼怒地闪烁了一下，再次驳回了自它回归以来哑谜对它反复提出的指控。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>事实上，如果不是我打开了沙滩里的密码锁，我们根本发现不了玩具箱出了问题，更不知道这该死的语言异化症来自哪儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>本不该在房间里的两位研究员彼此交换了一个眼色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很明显，比起和实验室里满口数字字母的同僚共事，他们更乐意参与到眼前的“项目”中来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>这是第几次了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>算上他俩刚从玩具箱出来时的那回吵架？第八次。嘘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>或者，如果你专注你的项目，别管那些棋子发生了什么，就能及时在玩具箱带来乱子前把它还给狐狸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>而不是像现在这样，让魔盒里的绝望跑得到处都是，“潘多拉”先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>别开玩笑了！语言异化症蔓延的速度快得离谱——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>刚刚那个来通知的欧文还能听懂英语，汉娜从昨天下午开始就变得只能理解希尔密码的符号。你如何断言状况不会发生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>把你沉迷过家家游戏的时间刨除，完成“暴雨”前演练的总时长可以缩减至少三成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>假设你的玻璃脑袋还没被编码语言搞坏——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>假设你不是只会挖苦，而是有哪怕一点真正的作用——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一场再次发生的争论。在升级为更激烈的争吵前，它被一个细弱却不容忽视的声音打断了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>先生……先生们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>抱歉打断您，但是……语言异化症？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体转过身，努力平缓自己的剧烈波动，并无视了一旁蛇发女妖那明显带有遗憾意味的叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>是的，马库斯小姐。如你所见，拉普拉斯从四天前开始陷入了一场语言混乱，二进制编码、摩斯电码、栅栏密码……几乎所有人都开始用奇怪的符号系统讲话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我们推测这一切和用于模拟雨前演练的玩具箱有关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>一周前缪斯三世检查箱子时提到了有东西失窃，这之后，语言异化症就从箱子所在的楼层开始迅速蔓延……并且仍没有停止的迹象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>虽然这一情况目前尚无其他异变，除了沟通效率之外也暂未造成其他影响，但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩儿的神情紧张起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>您担心……它可能会引起时代的混乱……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不不不，放松些，没那么严重，应该不会引起一次室内“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但它绝对会引起拉普拉斯每周例会、实验室经费申请、以及员工食堂自助选餐的混乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>换言之，引起拉普拉斯全部日程的混乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>嗯……可是，我怎样才能帮上您的忙？我不懂密码，也不擅长数学……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>上一次，你从那个“奇迹的魔圈”里听写出了那份咒文，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>突破了状态与形式的隔阂，直接对目标进行解读……这是你的神秘术？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这次也是和语言有关的谜题。我认为，既然普通的信息沟通出现障碍，你也许能从书页上阅读出额外的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我明白了，我会尽我所能——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>或许是阿德勒研究员的衬托，如此平和流畅的交流让乌尔里希赞许地点点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>缪斯三世已经在确认相关情况了，走吧，我们得去敲定后续的行动方案。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">缪斯三世：</div><div>我会持续维护玩具箱，尽力抑制语言污染的扩散，与此同时——真抱歉，恐怕得请你们再进到玩具箱里去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>还来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑头发研究员狠狠瞪着双头狐狸玩偶，语气里充满了不可置信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">缪斯三世：</div><div>这次不太一样，朋友们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">缪斯三世：</div><div>玩具箱的核心不翼而飞，但并没有“飞”远。我确信它还在箱子里，只是不在它原本该在的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">缪斯三世：</div><div>90%以上的可能性，核心位于玩具箱程序层——也就是玩具箱的更下层。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>先等会儿，狐狸，你最好说清楚，我们到底要找什么？一个棋子，一枚零件？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">缪斯三世：</div><div>喔……这正是难点所在。我很难给你描述它的样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">缪斯三世：</div><div>根据我检查的结果来看，箱内的认知系统已经紊乱，也就是说，它或许没有能被稳定识别的形态……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">缪斯三世：</div><div>但别沮丧，您瞧，就像被污染的语言仍发挥语言功能，这枚核心也必然还保留着它维持认知的特性，也许您会发现，它的形态变化有其规律……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管缪斯三世以轻缓的口吻和委婉的语调，发挥了它作为一位商人与一只毛绒玩偶所能发挥的全部安抚能力，乌尔里希和哑谜的脸色此刻仍然不太好看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>所以我们要在几乎毫无情报的情况下，找一个会变形的“普罗透斯”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">缪斯三世：</div><div>事实确实如此，亲爱的朋友……很遗憾我没有海豹皮给你们。另外——如果拉普拉斯的语言已经成了这个样子，玩具箱里棋子们的状况恐怕只会更糟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">缪斯三世：</div><div>你们还有转译器吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人看向始终保持沉默的APPLe。这沉默和往常不同，似乎并非出于一位绅士的谦逊，而是出于某种令人尴尬的困境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>……窝这里还友最厚一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">缪斯三世：</div><div>噢！那群黑色绒毛小家伙的语言。真有意思，这的确也称得上是一种符号系统。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苹果表皮的色泽从未如此红润。它飞快地将转译器递给乌尔里希，细小的爪子与磁流体郑重交握。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>请尽筷把哎剖某从困镜中解酒出来吧，拜脱了，蓬友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体深深颤动了一下，这大概等同于人类的深呼吸，能在糟透了的状况中带来一点聊胜于无的自我宽慰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>好吧，转译器、“普罗透斯”、语言与认知紊乱……听起来和“暴雨”前的混乱没什么两样，不过至少我已经学会了怎么和棋子打交道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我准备好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>不，是我准备好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哑谜黑着脸上前一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>以防你不合时宜的人道主义精神再次复发，这次我来。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>所以整个拉普拉斯就想不出一个能把这个该死的箱子问题彻底解决的办法吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>嘿，别抱怨了阿德勒，有你的信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我的？这张破纸片，用的还是拉普拉斯通用的演算纸，你怎么就知道这是我的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>问得太好了，第一点，这封信被夹在你门缝上的，第二点，有人用黑漆标注了一个大大的“看这里”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兔毛手袋翻了翻白眼，在它看来每做一件事都得解释一遍真的太麻烦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我很难想象除了投诉信，谁会用这么无聊的方式传纸条。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哑谜打开了纸条，那是一张很普通的拉普拉斯演算用纸，而上面的内容却一点都不普通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>虽然不知道是谁写的，但是里面提到了让我修一座……塔。一座能统一箱中所有语言的信号塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这听起来像是什么神话故事。Bonjour，阿德勒研究员，不好意思又听到了你们的对话。不过我还是想问一句——除了我们谁还知道里面的东西丢了呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>太好了，我们的保密工作做得就像在楼下公开演讲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>该死的，洛伦兹他们一定是闻着神秘学事故的怪味找上来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>可疑的奇怪结社，可是方法理论上确实可行，只要统一了语言就可以完美地解决现在所有的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>如果这封建议来自洛伦兹，他们为什么要帮助我们？……马库斯小姐，你能从这张纸片上看出些什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哑谜将纸条递给女孩儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯注视着这张小小的纸片。字与句，这是最易读的形式，她总能从中提取许多信息，但现在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩皱着眉头，露出困惑不解的神情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这份笔迹很精巧，像机械一样，看起来是由看重形式、追求完美的人写下的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可是，书写者握笔的力度几乎是在涂鸦，说明，呃，那人的性格恰好与上个结论相反……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>书写目的为……没有目的？只是单纯的笔画组合……这不可能，我……我看不懂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我看就是他们自己也被语言异化搞坏了脑子，想快点解决这个病症，又或许——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>只要有什么跟“暴雨”沾上边了，他们会像魔精一样冒出来。模拟的“暴雨”也算“暴雨”，至少它现在有明显的奇怪特征了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>好吧，无论如何，我们现在要在箱子里修建一座通天的巨塔，然后把所有的人都笼罩在一种语言下。真是伟大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看来他们又需要进行一次探险，但是好消息是他们至少知道自己需要做什么了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我会在外面为你提供支援的，阿德勒研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你现在能帮忙的就是给我们每人准备一顶安全帽，毕竟我们现在都要去箱子里建塔了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>哦对，也别忘记准备你自己的，不过得大一点，一般的帽子你的玻璃脑袋可戴不上。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-301020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-301020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-301020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>他们真的做到了，我还以为会失败然后封存。看起来下次的线索还得提供得更隐蔽一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-301020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-301020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-301020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>让我想想给洛伦兹的报告该怎么圆呢。</div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E6.95.B0.E5.AD.97.E8.AF.AD.E8.A8.80.E2.80.9D.E7.BF.BB.E8.AF.91\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“数字语言”翻译\">“数字语言”翻译</span></h2>\n<p>剧情开头的“数字语言”实际上由ASCII十进制编码值依次拼接而成。翻译如下：\n</p>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉普拉斯研究员：</b></span>7711446328510811410599104？ <span style=\"color:#bc9567; font-size:smaller;\">（Mr. Ulrich? / 乌尔里希组长？）</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉普拉斯研究员：</b></span>841011143911532973210211112032104101114101321161113211510111132121111117。<span style=\"color:#bc9567; font-size:smaller;\">（Ter's a fox here to see you. / 有个奇怪的狐狸头想要找你。）</span><br />\n…………<br />\n</p>\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉普拉斯研究员：</b></span>79104！<span style=\"color:#bc9567; font-size:smaller;\">（Oh!  / 噢。）</span></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "雨前漫游指南3.1/剧情"}}